{"version":1,"content":"<p>蘋果近日展示Apple Music新視覺標識的製作過程。團隊與英國音樂製作人Fred again及NEST Acoustics合作，先為品牌片頭創作一組短音符，再用聲音驅動液體振動，讓Apple Music標誌隨波紋扭曲起伏，呈現出類似「聲波雕塑」的效果。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/music/1583254.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:44.785105+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":133,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T15:54:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.633892+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.633892+00:00","content_hash":"de88797c148f749ea892b494ffeb5f5ac2df8df315f77ccbbf5f7b5142d2b041","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}